# CBMQS Deployment Matrix

The Chicago Bare-Metal Qualification Standard v1
(arcus `docs/jira/v26.11.3/cbmqs-standard.md`), rendered from the RDF graph
(`packs/cscb-pack/ontology.ttl`). Every threshold is in its exact receipted
form; values are the AF-2-corrected ones
(`file:///Users/sac/arcus/docs/jira/v26.11.3/dflss-aoq-claims-audit.md`).
Source of truth: the graph; this table is a projection, never a second
source of truth. Never round up. A gate whose court cannot flip is FAIL;
a skip is loud.

## The seven gates

| Gate | Name | Threshold (exact receipted form) | Reference receipt | Measurement method | Disqualification |
